# What `gcloud builds submit engine` uploads: the build context the Dockerfile needs, nothing
# else (no virtualenv, tests, runs, keys or .env). Mirrors .dockerignore.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
!docker/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/litestream.yml
!samples/
!samples/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
docker/README.md
docker/smoke.py
